<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0389_R35R0201_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I heard about the Bug-Catchin’ Contest\nwhere bug lovers come from all over.\r...Me? I can’t STAND bugs. I’m here to\nprotest.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0389_R35R0201_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Bug-Catchin’ Contest happen\nTuesday, Thursday, and Saturday.\rYou get a prize just for showin’ up!\nThat’s a participation trophy. For\fbugs.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0389_R35R0201_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sorry, the Pokéathlon Dome still under\nconstruction. Entrance off-limits.\rYou know what a rush job is? It’s when\nthey say “two weeks” for a year.\rJust a lil more patience, OK?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0389_R35R0201_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Pokéathlon Dome this way.\rGo through the entrance gate\nand get in the games!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0389_R35R0201_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">ARRGH! When the Pokéathlon gon’ be\nREADY?!\rI can’t just sit here! I’ma run around\nJohto! Twice!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0389_R35R0201_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I been waitin’ for THIS!\rWitness the bond with my homies!\nWe matchin’ tracksuits!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0389_R35R0201_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I wonder if I can join too.\nIt’s just runnin’ with homies, right?\fI ain’t ran since ’96.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0389_R35R0201_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Play together with your homies,\ntrust your homies, and believe\fin your homies!\rThe bond with your homies\nmake your dreams come true!\rPokéathlon for you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0389_R35R0201_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Charge up with friendship!\nGive your homies Aprijuice!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0389_R35R0201_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tap tap ding ding!\rWe in a big hurry!\nJust a lil more work before you\fcan come through.\rI hope you lookin’ forward to it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0389_R35R0201_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, ayo! Watch yourself!\rConstruction make it dangerous around\nhere. I already lost a toe.\r</language>
	</row>
</body>
